had a meandering journey and not a typical route to the profession. I wholeheartedly recommend the book for both personal and professional reasons. Be prepared to put evening tasks on hold for a while though. because once you've started reading, it's tough to put it down. What if the thing you've been searching for your whole life isn't happiness, not success, not confidence, not motivation? What if it's safety? Because when humans feel truly safe, something remarkable happens. We learn, we connect, we create and we grow.

